usage: run_p3s_b3.py [-h] --manifest MANIFEST --candidate CANDIDATE
                     --outdir OUTDIR [--cache-inventory CACHE_INVENTORY]
                     [--p2v-expected18 P2V_EXPECTED18] [--timeout TIMEOUT]
                     [tests ...]

P3S B2 runner (DRAFT, root readback required)

positional arguments:
  tests                 explicit unittest selectors (default full P3S test
                        module)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --manifest MANIFEST   immutable static21 JSON path (supplied after CoWorkerA
                        return)
  --candidate CANDIDATE
                        candidate worktree path (supplied after CoWorkerA
                        return)
  --outdir OUTDIR       new output dir (must not exist; use different OUTDIR
                        per smoke/full)
  --cache-inventory CACHE_INVENTORY
  --p2v-expected18 P2V_EXPECTED18
  --timeout TIMEOUT
